# Potential Persistence Via Logon Scripts - Registry | T1037.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_persistence_logon_scripts_userinitmprlogonscript.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13 TargetObject="*UserInitMprLogonScript*"
